# Next.js App 2025 - Cursor Rules

## Tech Stack

- Next.js 15.4.6 with App Router
- React 19.1.0
- TypeScript (strict mode)
- Tailwind CSS v4
- Turbopack for fast builds/dev

## Key Documentation

- Bizzabo Partner API: https://bizzabo.stoplight.io/docs/bizzabo-partner-apis/216a013c43f8e-bizzabo-public-api
- Next.js 15 docs: https://nextjs.org/docs
- Tailwind v4 docs: https://tailwindcss.com/docs/v4-beta
- React 19 docs: https://react.dev/

## Project Structure

```
apps/2025/
├── src/
│   └── app/          # App Router pages
│       ├── globals.css
│       ├── layout.tsx
│       └── page.tsx
├── public/           # Static assets
└── package.json
```

## Development

- Uses Turbopack: `npm run dev` (runs `next dev --turbopack`)
- Part of monorepo - run `pnpm dev` from root for full development
- UI components imported from `@repo/ui` package

## API Integration

- Integrates with Bizzabo Partner API for event management
- Use TypeScript for all API interactions
- Follow Next.js API route patterns for backend integration

## Code Style

- TypeScript strict mode enabled
- Use Tailwind v4 syntax with CSS variables
- Follow Next.js 15 App Router conventions
- Use React 19 features where appropriate
